{
"file": 940,
"paths": [
"d008/d106/f026"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "3f80f260",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "d92525b7",
"en_raw": "...Nao, Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "cd15c534",
"en_raw": "Where did those two go?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "a0dd70c1",
"en_raw": "Well, well, so that's how it is..."
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "08c549fb",
"en_raw": "(Alone together for Lady Rasen, huh...)"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "08aa2475",
"en_raw": "(That's pretty bold"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "57fb75d7",
"en_raw": "for Nao...)"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "9dc8d777",
"en_raw": "What are you doing in front of the classroom?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "98b24f91",
"en_raw": "...Takumi Yamazaki!"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "fe0d6bb0",
"en_raw": "What are you doing at this hour?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "984cd0d6",
"en_raw": "That's my line"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "35013cbd",
"en_raw": "The committee ran long"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "3819434b",
"en_raw": "I was going to finish prepping"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "14577bd6",
"en_raw": "for the quiz..."
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "51091cd6",
"en_raw": "Studying in the classroom now?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "9dcc99f9",
"en_raw": "I can concentrate better"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "554bf122",
"en_raw": "in the classroom than at home"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "815875e5",
"en_raw": "Move away from there"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "72261482",
"en_raw": "U-um, why not do it in the library"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "d2555105",
"en_raw": "It's quiet, nice"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "c1196393",
"en_raw": "The library's already locked"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "fa1baf87",
"en_raw": "Oh, right..."
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "c8807e38",
"en_raw": "Anyway, move"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "53f2ee96",
"en_raw": "U-um, listen"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "9ae6db4f",
"en_raw": "This may be none of my business"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "bea89e10",
"en_raw": "but take today off"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "9ab75296",
"en_raw": "You'll die of overwork from studying"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "d46babf9",
"en_raw": "You don't want to die in middle school, right?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "718e01c0",
"en_raw": "What are you talking about?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "0141ab35",
"en_raw": "No, really, you're admirable"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "9b59d9a6",
"en_raw": "doing committee and studying both"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "2a9524a5",
"en_raw": "Compared to that"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "fbc33a90",
"en_raw": "Takayuki Nishi"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "47f998bf",
"en_raw": "is in the go-home club, no committee"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "28ca64c5",
"en_raw": "takes the world lightly"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "25e604a1",
"en_raw": "Quit saying"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "03146487",
"en_raw": "nonsense..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "cc859973",
"en_raw": "Sorry, please"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "9635a926",
"en_raw": "listen to what I say!"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "4d26e262",
"en_raw": "Like that would convince me"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "c0ea393f",
"en_raw": "Explain properly, will you?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "292317c6",
"en_raw": "If you can't explain"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "c96ca591",
"en_raw": "I've no reason"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "b3cf628d",
"en_raw": "to listen to you"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "a152e619",
"en_raw": "It's not even open"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "67dd8d92",
"en_raw": "...Right, right"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "c4eadbc9",
"en_raw": "So you'd better go home quickly!"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "ce31a6a5",
"en_raw": "Say that first"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "83f24f4e",
"en_raw": "Honestly..."
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "e7c15765",
"en_raw": "(Come to think of it, it's unreasonable"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "802f6297",
"en_raw": "Why do I have to"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "e6a965d2",
"en_raw": "make this pointless effort"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "8d99a3e0",
"en_raw": "for Nao's sake?)"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "ba33d360",
"en_raw": "...Right"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "fbc99831",
"en_raw": "It's none of my business"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "bc68b110",
"en_raw": "...Go ahead"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "a4d7d647",
"en_raw": "...It's locked, though"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "ce31a6a5",
"en_raw": "Say that first"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "83f24f4e",
"en_raw": "Honestly..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "4494542a",
"en_raw": "Please, go home today"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "ab16c2c4",
"en_raw": "Cool Yamazaki!"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "60bbda87",
"en_raw": "What's with this girl"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "72f321fd",
"en_raw": "I can't deal with this"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "02fefcdb",
"en_raw": "(Damn it, that Nao"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "78312681",
"en_raw": "I won't forget"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b0b39644",
"en_raw": "this humiliation...)"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "6aa32d2b",
"en_raw": "Hey, what are you doing in street clothes?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "1a066a88",
"en_raw": "(The worst person"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "dca34200",
"en_raw": "showed up at the worst time...)"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "ef00a7ad",
"en_raw": "Who's the worst, ugly"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "fdd951b7",
"en_raw": "You are, shorty"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "b8472803",
"en_raw": "Hee hee hee hee"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "f699485d",
"en_raw": "W-what, that's creepy"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "449bf3f8",
"en_raw": "You're hiding something, aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "a8756c82",
"en_raw": "What if I am?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "8130fa8c",
"en_raw": "I have the right to see it"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "7b6fdd29",
"en_raw": "What are you saying, go home, idiot"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "327e5a9b",
"en_raw": "Is it okay, being in street clothes"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "e910c953",
"en_raw": "wandering around school"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "95a7f430",
"en_raw": "if Kamei finds out?"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "a76784fd",
"en_raw": "I'm going home soon anyway..."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "0d94d0e8",
"en_raw": "What about you, what are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "de806826",
"en_raw": "Patrolling the school"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "09a172d3",
"en_raw": "Today we, the baseball club"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "7f59859b",
"en_raw": "were last"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "bd5f17c9",
"en_raw": "Making you do the patrol"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "b10c8ff9",
"en_raw": "the baseball club's messed up"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "d9232d18",
"en_raw": "Say what you want"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "5b3981b8",
"en_raw": "But"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "232a4d73",
"en_raw": "if you don't want it exposed..."
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "153eedf6",
"en_raw": "Is that okay?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "3170444a",
"en_raw": "Is it okay?"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "bc9edaa2",
"en_raw": "...Look forward to tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "df522f60",
"en_raw": "Kamei's lecture..."
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "c3b9e507",
"en_raw": "Why me..."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "890c0939",
"en_raw": "...Fine, let's make a deal"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "cdf66a9f",
"en_raw": "If you keep my business"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "2596f898",
"en_raw": "a secret"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "5d6f9ac2",
"en_raw": "I'll keep quiet about that too"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "93cbdba5",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, that?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "e036eeac",
"en_raw": "Playing dumb is useless"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "49e5900e",
"en_raw": "I saw it"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "9f42450f",
"en_raw": "That won't"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "d6a2faf8",
"en_raw": "fool me, old man"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "ef94da1e",
"en_raw": "Oh really, then I'll say it"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "be838f97",
"en_raw": "Going to buy at the dirty magazine corner"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "e8aeba4f",
"en_raw": "Diving into the Tama River drain"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "08f80837",
"en_raw": "Breaking the UFO catcher"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "6c52fa3d",
"en_raw": "at the arcade"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "cc70d778",
"en_raw": "Getting scolded by a cop at the vacant lot..."
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "b33fd490",
"en_raw": "There's more, though...?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "0f9f4a8b",
"en_raw": "How do you know?"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "c1d01439",
"en_raw": "Misdeeds get around"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "3e07a6a4",
"en_raw": "Get lost already"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "d9fca9de",
"en_raw": "...Well, I'm fine either way"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "fca947e1",
"en_raw": "What, say it..."
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "f3896692",
"en_raw": "Remember this!"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "a1ba102e",
"en_raw": "(Phew..."
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "64f300fd",
"en_raw": "I made that up"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "ec37de30",
"en_raw": "but did he really"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "9dd87bdc",
"en_raw": "do all that...)"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "cdcd9695",
"en_raw": "(...Biggest bad feeling ever)"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "d522d948",
"en_raw": "...Ugh, Keina Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "50ca8ce5",
"en_raw": "Well, if it isn't"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "ced4e8f0",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi?"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "958a7993",
"en_raw": "Shh, not so loud"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "dc2c18f1",
"en_raw": "What are you doing there?"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "37221165",
"en_raw": "Do I look like I'm doing something?"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "87efcec9",
"en_raw": "Yes, very much so"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "209c5aa7",
"en_raw": "Oh, I see"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "6999763c",
"en_raw": "That's a big misunderstanding"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "3efccfb8",
"en_raw": "It's my hobby"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "f58bb92c",
"en_raw": "What kind of hobby?"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "aa0c96ed",
"en_raw": "Writing poems themed on"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "bfe6d982",
"en_raw": "the school hallway in the evening"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "5f4018de",
"en_raw": "Hmm"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "f7bafcf2",
"en_raw": "So, when people are around"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "56d9e802",
"en_raw": "my concentration"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "df11835f",
"en_raw": "gets disrupted"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "27b9a665",
"en_raw": "Sorry, sorry"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "252f60a1",
"en_raw": "I'll go right away"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "3f1a5946",
"en_raw": "Let me get my bag?"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "c752ad00",
"en_raw": "...No"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "05288be5",
"en_raw": "Then you can't go home"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "0039bb1e",
"en_raw": "(I'm saying this since I think we're friends"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "5776a6ba",
"en_raw": "Please just leave quietly)"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "a8c04cec",
"en_raw": "You and your bad jokes"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "2bf8abe8",
"en_raw": "(There are things in this world"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "7902582f",
"en_raw": "that you're glad you didn't see,"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "d2edf19c",
"en_raw": "you know)"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "b7fde86e",
"en_raw": "Like splatter videos"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "0f7c430e",
"en_raw": "the underpass?"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "a047c24c",
"en_raw": "(...A request?)"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "73c66a6d",
"en_raw": "Even if you say that..."
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "ea2bf9ca",
"en_raw": "Without my bag I can't do homework"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "29849e29",
"en_raw": "and if I don't do it, I'll be scolded"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "e1bf6e3b",
"en_raw": "I can't back down either"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "05840a2c",
"en_raw": "(...Ah"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "5f2931f1",
"en_raw": "I can't hold it in anymore)"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "61505141",
"en_raw": "You don't have to force yourself"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "aa51aa96",
"en_raw": "to hold it in alone"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "5402cc54",
"en_raw": "(I don't know anymore, I warned you)"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "61663c26",
"en_raw": "Yeah, thanks"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "2686e86a",
"en_raw": "How weird..."
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "4dbf5a5c",
"en_raw": "...Ah!!"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "e6f6b4bc",
"en_raw": "(Shh, don't make a sound"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "ded8fa8f",
"en_raw": "I told you not to look)"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "cb0eca2c",
"en_raw": "(Hey, Hirauchi..."
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "7cd5479c",
"en_raw": "was Naoki Murase always such"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "bcad40d4",
"en_raw": "a bold guy?)"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "07622786",
"en_raw": "(When certain conditions are met"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "5bad972e",
"en_raw": "he becomes endlessly"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "74c5eda6",
"en_raw": "shameless"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "ce0347fc",
"en_raw": "See, the honor student's other face?)"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "c5d36185",
"en_raw": "(Shiina's also kind of"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "7d291352",
"en_raw": "too unguarded)"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "05470ce8",
"en_raw": "(That's why I'm the watcher)"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "6fbd1486",
"en_raw": "(But they seem super close...)"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "6b2d3bd9",
"en_raw": "(That's an illusion"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "4d889030",
"en_raw": "Shiina's like that with everyone)"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "174e12ad",
"en_raw": "...Opening it!"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "44711d1a",
"en_raw": "...No!"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "3ef10089",
"en_raw": "(...Why are you stopping me?)"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "67b967cf",
"en_raw": "(...I stop you no matter what)"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "dce4b17e",
"en_raw": "(...Aren't you frustrated?)"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "34e74bb9",
"en_raw": "(...What do you"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "871eb1f8",
"en_raw": "mean frustrated?)"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "45909464",
"en_raw": "...Anyway, opening it!"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "44711d1a",
"en_raw": "...No!"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "174e12ad",
"en_raw": "...Opening it!"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "44711d1a",
"en_raw": "...No!"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "31e555f5",
"en_raw": "...! Opening"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "5936a2ae",
"en_raw": "(Ah, they're coming out!)"
}
]
}